{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-22006","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-22006-item-ItemConfigEquipment-22006-0","text":"记忆命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-22006-item-ItemConfigEquipment-22006-1","text":"轻风吹散了云朵，露出银河的模样。\n黄金的光辉闪耀，史诗将于星空传颂。\n\n「流星，相逢，约定！」\n小妖精望着天空，一如初见，一如重逢。\n\n「迷迷，等待。开拓，世界！」\n小妖精的眼眸被星光照亮——闪烁着，恰如那粉色的明天。","speaker":""}]}
